---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="High Nickel Alloys — Inconel Pipes & Tubes" active="/products">
  <section class="pagebanner">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)">Inconel 600 · 700 · 800 Series</p>
      <h1>High Nickel Alloys</h1>
      <p>Nickel-chromium Inconel 600 for corrosion and high-temperature service from cryogenic to 2000°F — non-magnetic, high-strength, weldable.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="visual">
    <img src="/product-high-nickel.webp" alt="High-Nickel Alloys product photography" />
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell productcontent">
      <aside>Bhansali Metals<br />Product briefing</aside>
      <div>
<h3>Inconel 600 series</h3>
<p>Inconel 600 is a nickel-chromium alloy for applications requiring corrosion and high-temperature resistance — designed for service from cryogenic to elevated temperatures around 2000°F. Non-magnetic with excellent mechanical properties, it combines high strength with good weldability across a wide temperature range. High nickel content retains resistance under reducing conditions, resists many organic and inorganic compounds, gives excellent resistance to chloride-ion stress-corrosion cracking and to alkaline solutions. Typical applications: chemical, pulp and paper, aerospace, nuclear engineering and heat-treating industries.</p>
<h3>Forms stocked at Bhansali Metals</h3>
        <div class="details">
        <div>
          <b>Sheet</b>
          <span>Corrosion and heat-resistant sheet</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Plate</b>
          <span>Heavy-gauge plate for severe service</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Bar</b>
          <span>Round, square and hex bar</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Pipe & tube</b>
          <span>Welded and seamless pipe and tube</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Fittings</b>
          <span>Flanges, slip-ons, blinds, weld-necks, lap joints, long welding necks, socket welds, elbows, tees, stub-ends, returns, caps, crosses, reducers and pipe nipples</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Wire</b>
          <span>Drawn wire for fabrication and specialists</span>
        </div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem">
          <a class="button" href="/enquiry">Request a quote ↗</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
